# Testing Rules

- Bug fix → add or extend a regression test in `tests/`.
- New validator or service behavior → unit test.
- New or changed route → integration test under `tests/integration/`.
- Run `npm test` before marking backend work complete.
- Do not skip or delete failing tests to pass CI.
